          "source_block": 4,
          "candidate_block": 3,
          "candidate_line_count": 6,
          "center_error": 13.203,
          "text": "Article 1 In accordance with the Guiding Opinions on High­Quality Business Operations\nof the Company, and in conjunction with the relevant requirements of the Group\nCompany's Implementation Rules for High­Quality Business Operations (Trial) (CCECC\nOperations [2024]341 ), this Measures is hereby formulated to comprehensively\nimprove project business quality, effectively manage the company's domestic business\noperations, and standardize business procedures and workflows."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 8,
          "candidate_block": 4,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 16.225,
          "text": "Article 2 Projects referred to in these Measures mean all types of company business\nundertaken through direct entrustment or bidding, including consulting, survey, design,\nsupervision, engineering procurement construction, etc."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 14.864,
          "text": "Article 3 In principle, business undertaking work shall follow the procedure of project\nassessment first, then application for approval, and finally contract si gning."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 12,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 8,
          "center_error": 15.644,
          "text": "Article 4 When carrying out project business undertaking work, factors such as\nthe company's development strategy, business direction, responsibility cost,\nproduction and technical capabilities, and current status shall be co\nmprehensively considered, and in accordance with the process provisions of\nthese Measures, the work of such stages as \"information tracking, project\nassessment and application, bid document preparation and review, contract\nnegotiation, contract review and signing, owner services during project\nimplementation, and project return visits\" shall be completed."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 17,
          "candidate_block": 7,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 3.826,
